Backport tools/fakeroot 2.1.3 from openwrt main to openwrt-25.12.

Why: on openwrt-25.12 the host fakeroot is 1.37.1.2, and with it `apk mkpkg`
deadlocks in our builder container (debian trixie). The fingerprint, seen four
times on 2026-10-04/06 in the nr7101-stable image leg (runs 37194316303,
37214945447, 37436829266): zero CPU load, the fakeroot wrapper blocked in
pipe_read with no apk process of its own, and faked idle in do_select — the
wrapper never gets the key its command substitution waits for. It is not a
parallel-build race; it reproduces with make -j1 from a cleanly killed tree.

The correlation across our legs is exact:

  nr7101  master   upstream main                fakeroot 2.1.3      green
  nr7101  stable   upstream openwrt-25.12       fakeroot 1.37.1.2   hangs
  chateau stable   fork chateau-stable-backport fakeroot 2.1.3      green
  chateau master / nbg7815 / lte3301 (forks)    fakeroot 2.1.3      green

Every leg with 2.1.3 builds; the only leg with 1.37.1.2 hangs. The fork
branches carry the bump already, upstream 25.12 does not — so this patch gives
the one leg that builds from upstream 25.12 the same tool.

Generated as `git diff openwrt-25.12 main -- tools/fakeroot` and applied by
.github/ci/build-images.sh. It can go once 25.12 bumps fakeroot itself; then
the patch stops applying and the leg fails loudly, which is the intended way
to notice.

diff --git a/tools/fakeroot/Makefile b/tools/fakeroot/Makefile
index 1b8fba25..f8b0233c 100644
--- a/tools/fakeroot/Makefile
+++ b/tools/fakeroot/Makefile
@@ -5,16 +5,18 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=fakeroot
-PKG_VERSION:=1.37.1.2
+PKG_VERSION:=2.1.3
 PKG_RELEASE:=1
 
-PKG_SOURCE:=$(PKG_NAME)_$(PKG_VERSION).orig.tar.gz
+PKG_SOURCE:=$(PKG_NAME)_$(PKG_VERSION).orig.tar.xz
 PKG_SOURCE_URL:=@DEBIAN/pool/main/f/fakeroot
-PKG_HASH:=959496928c8a676ec8377f665ff6a19a707bfad693325f9cc4a4126642f53224
+PKG_HASH:=f28e33187b19ab0b6358ee40d5d8762f149cb19fa0423b6f40f605f5c80446bf
 PKG_LICENSE:=GPL-3.0-or-later
 PKG_LICENSE_FILES:=COPYING
 PKG_FIXUP:=autoreconf
 
+HOST_CONFIGURE_CACHE:=1
+
 include $(INCLUDE_DIR)/host-build.mk
 
 HOST_CONFIGURE_VARS += \
